The program was improved by adding input validation and better user experience features. The application checks if the input field is empty before performing the calculation.
It also verifies that the input is numeric using a try-except block. Additionally, the program prevents negative numbers and shows a clear error message if the input is invalid.
A Clear button was added to remove the text from the input field and reset the result label. The user interface was improved by adding padding between elements and changing the
result label color after calculation.
